Mobile Developer Days 2007

Mobile Developer Days will take place from Thursday 30th to Sunday 2nd
September 2007 at Aalborg University Denmark. The main idea is to create
a platform where developers, network operators, service providers, and
mobile manufactures can exchange their ideas and visions in the field of
mobile communication.

Aalborg University invites voluntary and professional software
developers to a four days gathering. This provides an opportunity for
developers, contributors and other interested people to meet in person
and work together more closely. Everybody working on Linux, Symbian, and
Windows Mobile platforms for mobile devices is invited. Main focus is on
sharing code and experiences when making applications for mobile devices
using C++, Python, Java, Open C and others. This is the first time the
*/mobile developer days/* event takes place but it is planed as an
annual event.

